1
00:02:30,059 --> 00:02:35,059
This is the time known as the Great Pirate Era.

2
00:02:35,059 --> 00:02:40,059
A countless array of pirates go to battle across the seas in search of the One Piece,

3
00:02:40,059 --> 00:02:44,059
the legendary treasure left behind by Gold Roger, King of the Pirates.

4
00:02:44,059 --> 00:02:49,059
Monkey D. Luffy, a boy whose body turned to rubber after eating the gum gum fruit,

5
00:02:49,059 --> 00:02:52,059
set sail to become the next King of the Pirates.

6
00:02:52,059 --> 00:02:55,059
As Luffy and his crew conquer numerous obstacles,

7
00:02:55,059 --> 00:02:58,059
they capture the unwanted attention of the world government,

8
00:02:58,059 --> 00:03:01,059
which will use any means necessary to stop them.

9
00:03:01,059 --> 00:03:04,059
Now this excites!

10
00:03:04,059 --> 00:03:07,059
I can't wait to see what kind of adventure's up next!

11
00:03:07,059 --> 00:03:11,059
With a charted course awash in danger and intrigue,

12
00:03:11,059 --> 00:03:15,059
the crew will cut a path across the Grand Line to the New World.

13
00:03:18,059 --> 00:03:24,059
Luffy grieved over the loss of his brother Ace in the War of the Best against the Navy.

14
00:03:24,059 --> 00:03:27,059
After recovering thanks to Jinbei's encouragement,

15
00:03:27,059 --> 00:03:30,059
he met with Dark King Rayleigh.

16
00:03:30,059 --> 00:03:32,059
Well then, that's it.

17
00:03:32,059 --> 00:03:35,059
If you think I should, I'll go back.

18
00:03:35,059 --> 00:03:37,059
To Marineford!

19
00:03:37,059 --> 00:03:42,059
One by one, the rest of the Straw Hats learned of the big news.

20
00:03:42,059 --> 00:03:46,059
No way! I don't believe it! Luffy!

21
00:03:46,059 --> 00:03:48,059
Uh, Luffy.

22
00:03:48,059 --> 00:03:51,059
Oh, good. He's safe.

23
00:03:51,059 --> 00:03:53,059
It's in today's paper?

24
00:03:53,059 --> 00:03:55,059
Whoa!

25
00:03:55,059 --> 00:04:03,059
Unexpected Relanding! Luffy to Marineford!

26
00:04:03,059 --> 00:04:12,059
At Navy Headquarters, located on the Grand Line.

27
00:04:12,059 --> 00:04:14,059
It's incomprehensible!

28
00:04:14,059 --> 00:04:19,059
During the War of the Best, it was revealed that Straw Hat is the late Portcastee Ace's adopted brother,

29
00:04:19,059 --> 00:04:22,059
on top of also being the son of the Revolutionary Dragon,

30
00:04:22,059 --> 00:04:25,059
which would make him the grandson of our own Vice Admiral Garp,

31
00:04:25,059 --> 00:04:27,059
if you're paying attention.

32
00:04:27,059 --> 00:04:30,059
So tell me, how did all of this slip past us?

33
00:04:30,059 --> 00:04:35,059
After the war, he went missing, but lo and behold, he was alive as we expected.

34
00:04:35,059 --> 00:04:41,059
Now, after everything that's happened, he has the call to come to Marineford again!

35
00:04:43,059 --> 00:04:45,059
A few days ago?

36
00:04:57,059 --> 00:04:59,059
The damage is unreal.

37
00:04:59,059 --> 00:05:00,059
What did you expect?

38
00:05:00,059 --> 00:05:04,059
It was an all-out war between the Navy elite and the world's greatest pirate.

39
00:05:04,059 --> 00:05:07,059
It's a miracle that the island is still standing, isn't it?

40
00:05:07,059 --> 00:05:09,059
So what brings you out to this pile of rubble?

41
00:05:09,059 --> 00:05:10,059
A story, of course.

42
00:05:10,059 --> 00:05:13,059
I came from Alabasta to cover Crocodile and Straw Hat.

43
00:05:13,059 --> 00:05:17,059
Though, supposedly, Straw Hat could already be dead.

44
00:05:17,059 --> 00:05:19,059
I'm sure the Navy wants you to think that,

45
00:05:19,059 --> 00:05:22,059
