46
00:05:22,059 --> 00:05:24,059
I mean, look at what they're dealing with here.

47
00:05:24,059 --> 00:05:26,059
That's true.

48
00:05:26,059 --> 00:05:29,059
The One Piece!

49
00:05:29,059 --> 00:05:33,059
The One Piece is real!

50
00:05:33,059 --> 00:05:38,059
With his dying words, Whitebeard inspired pirates all over the world.

51
